  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1189887.svg\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"386\" height=\"24\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>說明：</strong></span><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/linear pipes/screen.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;此資源包將所有來自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pipez</a>&nbsp;的管道方塊模型與紋理進行替換，使其外觀更精美，並與 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a> 完美搭配！</span></span></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/image.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"描述\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"描述\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此外，此版本還收錄了 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez : Mekanism Edition</a> 中的所有物品。</span></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/item.png?raw=true\" alt=\"描述\" width=\"915\" height=\"454\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此專案將 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez : Mekanism Edition</a> 的模型與紋理，與 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smart-pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smart Pipez</a> 的方塊模型邏輯相結合。<br></span></p>",
